  "details": "With the old QM you could see the User Rank and if they are on PC or Quest. This is currently not possible with the new QM. \nTo know what Platform they are on and what Rank they are, you would have to either see the nameplate ore use the old Main Menu.\nIdk if this is by design or something that got forgotten to add. \nIn a few ways it's good because you won't differentiate between people that much, but it's also kinda annoying. It makes it harder to know if you have this person hidden by Safety Settings or if the avatar just looks like that (e.g. Shader being hidden for Visitors). You also can't see if they are on Quest with the new QM, so you won't know what Avatar of you they are seeing.",
